# Cloudflare Pages redirects (copied into dist/ by Vite).
# /go/<channel>: the one link each social bio points at. It lands on the site with UTM tags so
# a signup can say which channel it came from (src/attribution.ts). 302, not 301, so the target
# can change later (e.g. a channel-specific landing page) without browsers caching the old one.
/go/ig       /?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=bio   302
/go/tt       /?utm_source=tiktok&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=bio      302
/go/yt       /?utm_source=youtube&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=bio     302
/go/x        /?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=bio           302
/go/threads  /?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=bio     302
/go/reddit   /?utm_source=reddit&utm_medium=community&utm_campaign=bio   302
/go/letter   /table?utm_source=letter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=link 302
